# Tasks: [Feature Name]

## Phase 1: Foundation

- [ ] **Database schema**: Add [model/fields] to prisma/schema.prisma and run migration
  - Verify: `pnpm prisma migrate dev` succeeds, `pnpm prisma generate` runs clean
- [ ] **Types**: Create type definitions in src/types/[name].types.ts
  - Verify: `pnpm tsc --noEmit` passes

## Phase 2: Backend

- [ ] **Repository**: Create src/repositories/[name].repository.ts with CRUD operations
  - Verify: Unit tests pass
- [ ] **Service**: Create src/services/[name].service.ts with business logic
  - Verify: Unit tests pass
- [ ] **API routes**: Create src/app/api/[resource]/route.ts with input validation
  - Verify: Integration tests pass, `curl` returns expected responses

## Phase 3: Frontend

- [ ] **Component**: Create src/components/[Name]/index.tsx
  - Must handle: loading state, error state, empty state, data state
  - Verify: Component tests pass
- [ ] **Page integration**: Wire component into page at src/app/[page]/page.tsx
  - Verify: Dev server shows feature working

## Phase 4: Verification

- [ ] **All tests pass**: `pnpm test -- --watchAll=false`
- [ ] **Lint clean**: `pnpm lint`
- [ ] **Types clean**: `pnpm tsc --noEmit`
- [ ] **Build succeeds**: `pnpm build`
- [ ] **Manual check**: Verify feature works end-to-end in dev server

## Phase 5: Cleanup

- [ ] **Update docs**: Update AGENTS.md if any new conventions were established
- [ ] **Update ARCHITECTURE.md**: If new modules/patterns were added
- [ ] **Remove TODOs**: Check for any TODO comments left behind
